1
00:00:00,421 --> 00:00:02,181
Seorang nabi yang sudah yakin

2
00:00:02,201 --> 00:00:03,774
masih memohon satu hal:

3
00:00:03,794 --> 00:00:05,368
perlihatkan kepadaku bagaimana

4
00:00:05,388 --> 00:00:06,952
Engkau menghidupkan yang mati.

5
00:00:06,972 --> 00:00:08,591
Surah Al-Baqarah ayat dua

6
00:00:08,611 --> 00:00:09,969
ratus enam puluh.

7
00:00:09,989 --> 00:00:11,422
Nabi Ibrahim berdoa:

8
00:00:11,442 --> 00:00:12,762
ya Tuhanku,

9
00:00:12,782 --> 00:00:14,399
perlihatkanlah kepadaku

10
00:00:14,419 --> 00:00:15,808
bagaimana Engkau menghidupkan

11
00:00:15,828 --> 00:00:16,658
orang mati.

12
00:00:16,678 --> 00:00:18,215
Sebagian ulama menyebut,

13
00:00:18,235 --> 00:00:19,268
doa ini datang setelah

14
00:00:19,288 --> 00:00:20,398
debatnya dengan sang raja

15
00:00:20,418 --> 00:00:21,188
tentang menghidupkan dan

16
00:00:21,208 --> 00:00:22,026
mematikan.

17
00:00:22,046 --> 00:00:23,183
Allah bertanya:

18
00:00:23,203 --> 00:00:24,613
belum percayakah engkau?

19
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:25,542
Ibrahim menjawab:

20
00:00:25,562 --> 00:00:26,562
aku percaya,

21
00:00:26,582 --> 00:00:28,219
tetapi agar hatiku tenang.

22
00:00:28,239 --> 00:00:29,272
Ia tidak ragu.

23
00:00:29,292 --> 00:00:31,284
Ia ingin keyakinannya menjadi

24
00:00:31,304 --> 00:00:32,679
sesuatu yang dilihat mata.

25
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:34,010
Perintahnya:

26
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:35,357
ambillah empat ekor burung,

27
00:00:35,377 --> 00:00:36,519
lalu cincanglah.

28
00:00:36,539 --> 00:00:37,757
Letakkan satu bagian di atas

29
00:00:37,777 --> 00:00:38,949
masing-masing bukit,

30
00:00:38,969 --> 00:00:40,456
berjauhan satu sama lain.

31
00:00:40,476 --> 00:00:42,306
Kemudian panggillah mereka,

32
00:00:42,326 --> 00:00:43,963
niscaya mereka datang kepadamu

33
00:00:43,983 --> 00:00:45,230
dengan segera.

34
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,406
Ibrahim memanggil,

35
00:00:46,426 --> 00:00:48,064
dan dari empat bukit,

36
00:00:48,084 --> 00:00:49,287
burung-burung itu datang

37
00:00:49,307 --> 00:00:51,227
kembali, hidup seperti semula.

38
00:00:51,247 --> 00:00:52,895
Ayat itu ditutup:

39
00:00:52,915 --> 00:00:54,613
ketahuilah, Allah Mahaperkasa,

40
00:00:54,633 --> 00:00:55,721
Mahabijaksana.

41
00:00:55,741 --> 00:00:56,943
Ibrahim melihatnya dengan mata

42
00:00:56,963 --> 00:00:57,891
kepala sendiri.

43
00:00:57,911 --> 00:00:59,656
Yang mengumpulkan kembali

44
00:00:59,676 --> 00:01:01,088
burung dari empat penjuru,

45
00:01:01,108 --> 00:01:02,682
mudah bagi-Nya membangkitkan

46
00:01:02,702 --> 00:01:03,391
manusia.

47
00:01:03,411 --> 00:01:04,583
Rasulullah bersabda dalam

48
00:01:04,603 --> 00:01:06,177
hadis riwayat Bukhari:

49
00:01:06,197 --> 00:01:07,679
kita lebih pantas ragu

50
00:01:07,699 --> 00:01:09,093
daripada Ibrahim.

51
00:01:09,113 --> 00:01:10,285
Para ulama menjelaskan,

52
00:01:10,305 --> 00:01:11,555
Ibrahim tidak ragu sama

53
00:01:11,575 --> 00:01:12,004
sekali.

54
00:01:12,024 --> 00:01:13,582
Yang ia cari adalah ketenangan

55
00:01:13,602 --> 00:01:14,654
hati.

56
00:01:14,674 --> 00:01:16,063
Bertanya untuk menenangkan

57
00:01:16,083 --> 00:01:17,456
hati bukan tanda iman yang

58
00:01:17,476 --> 00:01:18,419
lemah.

59
00:01:18,439 --> 00:01:20,641
Pertanyaan apa yang ingin kamu

60
00:01:20,661 --> 00:01:21,988
temukan jawabannya?

61
00:01:22,008 --> 00:01:23,428
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

62
00:01:23,448 --> 00:01:24,777
bersama AUDIRA.

